<title>QATAR: Iran Air starts new service to Qatar.</title>
<headline>Iran Air starts new service to Qatar.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Iran Air Boeing 737 landed in Doha on Sunday, launching the Iranian flag carrier's new weekly flight from the southern Iranian port city of Bushehr, Qatar's official news agency QNA said.</p>
<p>Iran Air already operates a weekly flight between the southern Iranian city of Shiraz and Doha.</p>
</text>
